      "text": "输入\n                            5\r\n3 8 9 1 6\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            9 8\r\n1 3 6 8 9\n                        \n\n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                8\r\n11 3 12 8 1 1 5 10\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                11 12\r\n1 1 3 5 8 10 11 12"
